<h1 class="main-title">
INDIA POST GDS RECRUITMENT 2026
</h1>

<p class="short-info">
India Post Department has released the notification for
Gramin Dak Sevak (GDS) Recruitment 2026.
Candidates can apply online for BPM, ABPM & Dak Sevak Posts.
Read official notification before applying.
</p>

